  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "17aa5d9c-feb9-4fef-8d4f-c4b8761eb3e5"],
 " component."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"495a115f-517d-4cb3-aaf0-1cb77812b65a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The BD formalism never inverts it. Negative powers appear only in the \
localized BV picture, where the BV action is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", 
    RowBox[{"-", "1"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4f1762f7-3b21-4454-b1f1-0bfb55e7c5e3"],
 " times the BD one."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ec04ac90-e47b-4126-970a-a9074d49e7bb"],

